Package: csv-grid-editor
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0
Maintainer: Local User <me@localhost>
Description: Rainbow CSV-style GTK editor with aligned columns and line numbers
 Edit CSV files in a spreadsheet-like grid with a pinned line-number column.
 Columns use distinct rainbow colors on a dark background, with alternating
 row colors that follow the system theme, hover info, CSVLint checks,
 RBQL-style queries, Group By column counts, empty-row cleanup, and Excel
 or Markdown clipboard export. Column widths and alignment are adjustable.
